---

This plugin is an independent reimplementation, for Obsidian, of the writing
mechanic created by @paveli in the Flow Writer web app
(https://github.com/paveli/Flow-Writer-App, https://flow-writer.com). No source
code from that project is included or derived here; it is written from scratch
against a different editor engine. Full credit for the original idea belongs to
its author.
